            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Unspecified\n\n# Included processes\nThe datasets takes as input the various electronic components required to build the controller and includes the components" production efforts. Assembly energy not included due to lack of data. The dataset returns the assembled device and production waste as a by-product.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
